      "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 4,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "I can imagine that must be tough. What happened with your thesis?",
      "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
      "identity": "91ab8559d611311b65adecbe91926c892d78fa367b27ef5d873ca2c3331457d4"
    },
    "p15/p15_conv_1:5": {
      "owner_id": "p15",
      "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 5,
      "speaker": "seeker",
      "text": "I got some feedback that I wasn't expecting. It made me realize there's a lot more work to do than I thought.",
      "reported_at": "2024-03-12",
      "identity": "f69901965d783372961b92037cf0a46d8d129dfed8be0c1fb013c8fd6be9d912"
    },
    "p15/p15_conv_1:6": {
      "owner_id": "p15",
      "session_id": "p15_conv_1",
      "session_rank": 0,
      "turn_index": 6,
      "speaker": "supporter",
      "text": "That sounds overwhelming. It can be really hard to digest unexpected feedback.",
